WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
For the next thirty seconds, do not think of a white bear.
Where did your mind go?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a 1987 experiment, people asked to suppress that thought
reported more of it afterward.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
But a later review of thirty-one studies found the immediate effect
depended on mental load. Timing matters.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A thought can be noticed without becoming a failure.
An instruction can offer a target rather than demand silence.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
That experiment did not test meditation audio.
A product's scientific promises need their own evidence.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the research. Try a free twelve-minute routine.
Choose for yourself.
